<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Kilakna</book>
  <para style="h">Kilakna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kilakna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kilakna</para>
  <para style="mt">Kilakna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Khrist kilakna, Pathian in a sikhate kiang a lahkhiak ding a amah a piak, thil hong ompah mahmah dingte: Huan aman a sikha Johan kiang ah a angel sawl in chiamtehna in a theisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Johan in Pathian thu leh Jesu Khrist tungtang a a thilmuhte tengteng a theisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hiai genkholhna thute sim a, a thute za a, huai a thil kigelhte zuite a hampha uhi: a hun a naitak ziak in .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johan in Asia gam a om saptuam sagihte kiang ah: Amah omlel, omsa leh hongpai ngei dingpa a kipan leh, a mangtutphah ma a om, Kha sagihte a kipan in hehpihna leh lemna na kiang uah om hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu Khrist, theihpihpa ginom, misite lak a piang masapen leh leitung a kumpipate vaihawmpa ahi. Eite hon it a i khelhna a kipan a a sisan a honsawppa amah kiang ngei ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />leh lalgam hi ding a honbawl, Pathian leh a Pa kiang a siampute hi ding a honbawl, amah kiang ah thupina leh vaihawmna, tangtawn, tangtawn in om hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, meipi toh a hongpai hi; mit teng in amah a mu ding ua, amah sunte’n leng; leitung a nam tengteng in amah a kah ding uh, huai bang hi hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kei Alpha leh Omega, a bul leh a tawp” Toupa Pathian, omsa, omlel leh hongpai ding Bangkim hihthei in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei, Johan, Jesu a om haksa thuakna leh lalgam leh kuhkalna a, na unau uleh na tanpihpa uh, Pathian leh Jesu theihpihna ziak in tuikulh gam Patmos kichi ah ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa ni in Kha in ka om hi, ka nunglam ah aw ngaihtak in pengkul ging bang ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw in, “Kei Alpha leh Omega, abul leh atawp ka hi, Na thilmuhte laibu ah gelh inla, Asia gam a saptuam sagih, Ephesa saptuam, Smarna saptuam, Pergamos saptuam, Thaitira saptuam, Sardis saptuam, Philadelphia saptuam leh Laodisia saptuamte kiang ah khak in” a chih ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan kei hon houpih huai aw muh tum in ka kihei hi. Huchi a ka kihei leh dangkaeng tuikuang koihna sagih ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai tuikuang koihna lai ah kuahiam Mihing Tapa toh kibang, a khepek tuampha puansilh, a awm kimvel dangkaeng gakna a kigak ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lu leh a sam samul ngou leh vuk bang in a ngou a; a mitte meikuang bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A khepekte sumsan nawttet meipi a halsiangsa a bang a, huan a aw tui tampi ging bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan a khut taklam in aksi sagih a tawi a; a kam a kipan in namsau hiamtuah a suakkhia a; huan a mel ni a sat sanlai bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi a amah ka muhtak in, misi bang in a khebul ah ka pukta hi. Huan aman a khut taklam ka tung a koih in, “Lau ken, a masapen leh a nanungpen ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing ka hi; ka hongsi a, ngai in tangtawn in ka hing hi, sihna leh misi khaw tahbi ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in na thil muhsate, thil omlelte leh tunung a thil hongom dingte gelh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka khut taklam a aksi sagih na muhte leh dangkaeng tuikuang koihna sagihte thuguk hiai ahi: Aksi sagihte saptuam sagihte angelte ahi ua; tuikuang koihna sagihte saptuam sagihte ahi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ephesa khua saptuamte angel kiang ah hichibang in gelh in: A khut taklam a aksi sagih tawi dangkaeng tuikuang koihna sagih lai a vialvakpa’n hiai thilte a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na thilhihte, na sepgim dan leh na kuhkal dan, migiloute na ngaihmoh dan leh hiloupi a amau sawltak kichite na ze-et a, amaute zuauthei ahi uh chih na muhkhiak dan ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan thuakzohna na nei a, ka min ziak in na thuak teitei a, huchi in leng na bah kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh n’on itna masapen na tawpsan thu ah k’on dem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in na pukna laitak theigige inla, kisik in, na thilhih masapente hih nawn in; huchilou in zaw na kiang ah ka hongpai dia, na kisik kei leh a omna kipan in na tuikuang koihna ka suan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh hiai thu ah na hoih, Nikol pawlte thilhihte na hua a, ken leng huaite ka hua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saptuamte kiang a Kha thugen bil nei peuh in za uhen. A vualzoupa kiang ah Pathian Paradise a om, hinna sing a nek ding in ka pe ding a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Huan Smarna khua a saptuamte angel kiang ah hichibang in gelh in: A masapen leh a nanungpen, huai si a hing nawnta in hiai thilte a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na thilhihte, na gimthuak dan leh na zawn dan, himahleh na hau hi, Judate hiloupi, ahi a kigen Setan kikhopna innte Pathian gensiatna ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na thuak pah ding thilte kihta ken; ngai in, ze-et a na om theihna ding un Diabol in na lak ua a khente suangkulh ah honkhum pah ding; ni sawm sung gimthuakna na nei ding uhi. Sihpha in ginom in om in, huchi in hinna lallukhu k’on pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saptuamte kiang a Kha thugen bilnei peuh in za uhen. A vualzoupa sih nihna hihnat in a omkei ding a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Huan Pergamom khua a saptuamte angel kiang ah hichibang in gelh in: Namsau hiam tak hiamtuah nei in hiai thilte a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tenna leh Setan mangtutphah omna leng ka thei hi; ka min kiptak in na lenden a, Setan tenna mun a ka palai ginom, Antipas thah a a omlai in leng na ginna na tawpsan tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh demna zek k’on nei, huailai a mi khenkhat Balaam sinsakna zuite na ompih ziak in, Israel tate ma a kipukna koih ding leh milimte kiang a kithoihna thilte ne ding leh kingaihna khelhna hih ding in aman tuh Balak a thuhilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi bangmah in Nikol pawlte sinsakna zui, mi khenkhat mah na ompih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in kisik in; huchilou in zaw na kiang ah ka hongpai pah dia, amau ka kam a namsau in ka dou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saptuamte kiang a Kha thugen bil nei peuh in za uhen. A vualzoupa kiang ah manna selguk ka pe ding, huan suangpek ka pedia, huai suang tung ah min thak, a neipa chih louh ngal theihlouh a kigelh a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Huan Thaitira khua a saptuamte angel kiang ah hichibang in gelh in: Pathian Tapa, meikuang bang mit nei a sumsan nawttet bang khe neipa’n, hiai thilte a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na thilhihte leh na itna leh na ginna leh na nasepna leh na thuakzohna ka thei hi, a masapen sang in na thilhih nanungte a tam zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh hiai thu ah demna k’on nei hi, huai numei Jezebel, zawlnei kichinu khawk na saklouh ziak in; aman ka sikhate kingaihna khelhna hih ding leh milimte kiang a kithoihna thilte ne ding a khem in a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in amah a kisikna ding in hun ka pia hi; huan a mingaihna khelhna ah a kisik tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai in, amah damlou lupna ah ka pai ding a, a thilhihte a kisik tuankei leh amah angkawm teng leng gimthuakna thupi ah ka pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan hi in a tate ka that dia; saptuamte tengteng in lungsim kiheinate leh lungtang theipa kei ka hi chih a thei ding uhi; na thilhihte bangbang un na lak ua mi tengteng ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh, nou, Thaitira a om midangte hiai thuhilh neilou a, ‘Setan thil thukte’ theilou tengteng kiang ah tunggikna dang na tung uah k’on behlap kei ding, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh ka hong mateng na neihpen uh lenkip un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan a vualzoupa leh a tawppha a ka nnate kempa kiang ah, namte tung a thuneihna ka pe ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman sik chiang in amau tung ah vai a hawm ding a, leibel bang in amau a khentam ding hi, hiai thuneihna ka Pa apan ka muh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan amah zingsol aksi ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Saptuamte kiang a Kha thugen bil nei peuh in za uhen a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Huan Sardis khua a saptuamte angel kiang ah hichibang in gelh in: Pathian Kha sagih leh aksi sagih neipa’n hiai thilte a gen hi: “Na thilhihte ka thei, sinapi in hingmin na pua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kiveng in, thil omsunte, sidia kisate, tungding nawn in; ka Pathian ma ah na thilhih zohsa settheih ka mu kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in na muhdan leh na zakdan theigige in; kem inla, kisik in. Huchi a na kiven kei leh guta bang in ka hongpai dia, bangchik hun in ahia nang k’on phawn ding chih na theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh Sardis khua ah min tawmchik a puante uh hihnin lou na nei hi; amaute puanngou silh a kei toh tonkhawm ding a kilawm him ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A vualzoupa huchibang in puanngou in a kizem dia, bangchi mah in hinna laibu a kipat a min ka hihmang kei ding hi, ka Pa ma leh angelte ma ah a min ka gum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saptuamte kiang a Kha thugen bil nei peuh in za uhen a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Philadelphia khua a saptuamte angel kiang ah hichibang in gelh in; Huai siangthoupa, dikpa leh David tahbi neipa, amah hon kuamah in a khak theihlouh leh amah khak kuamah in a hon theihlouh pa’n hiai thilte a gen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na thilhihte ka thei, ngai in, na ma ah kuamah khak theihlouh kong honsa ka koih hi; thilhihtheihna neuchik na nei a, ka thu na kem a, ka min na paikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai in, zuaulel gen a hilou napi Judate hi a kigen Setan omkhawmnate k’on pia hi; ngai in, amau k’on paisak dia, na khebul ah ka kunsak ding a, nang k’on it dan a theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka dohzohna thu na kep ziak in, ze-et a na om chiang in ken leng k’on kem ding, huai hun khovel pumpi tung a hongtung ding ahi, leitung a om tengteng leng ze-et ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hongpai pah dia: kuamah in na lallukhu a laklouhna ding in, na neihpen kem kinken in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A vualzoupa ka Pathian biakin ah khuam in ka pangsak dia, huai a kipan in a paikhe nawn kei ding, amah tung ah ka Pathian min leh ka Pathian khopi Jerusalem thak, ka Pathian a kipan van a hongpai khesuk min leh keimah min thak ka gelh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saptuamte kiang a Kha thugen bil nei peuh in za uhen a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Huan Laodisia khua a saptuamte angel kiang ah hichibang in gelh in: Theihpihpa ginom leh dik, Pathian thilsiam bul Amen in hiai thilte a gen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Na thilhihte ka thei, lum lah lumlou, vot lah votlou in na om a: na lum leh lum inla na vot leh vot vanglak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lum lah lumlou, vot lah votlou a, na om pelhpulh ziak in, ka kam a kipan in k’on sekhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi genthei nuamsa lou, zawng, mitdel leh vuaktang na hihlam kithei lou a, ‘ka hausa, hauhsaknate ka neita, bangmah ka kitasam kei’ na chih ziak in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei a kipan in dangkaeng mei a hih siangthousa lei ding in k’on thuhilh ahi, na hong hauhsak theihna ding in; puanngoute na honsilh a, na vuaktang zumhuaina a dawklouhna ding in; huan na muh theihna ding in na mit a nuh ding mitlou lei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka itte ka thuhilh in ka sawi a; huaiziak in phatuamngai inla, kisik in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai in kongkhak a ding in ka kiu hi: min ka aw a zak a kong a honleh a kiang ah ka lut dia amah toh nitakan ka ne dia, aman leng kei toh a ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A vualzoupa ka mangtutphah tung ah ka kiang ah ka tusak ding, keileng ka vualzou a, mangtutphah tung a ka Pa toh ka tut bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saptuamte kiang a Kha thugen bil nei peuh in za uhen a chi” chi in, a chi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai thilte nung in, ka et leh ngai in, van ah kongkhak a kihong hi: ka aw zak masapen pengkul aw ging bang in kei a hon houpih hi: “Hiai ah hongtou in, huchi in tunung chiang a thil hongom dingte k’on musak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai phet in Kha in ka om hi; Ngai in, van ah mangtutphah a hong kitungta a, mangtutphah tung ah mi khat a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai mi jasper leh karnelia suang bang in a kimu a; huai mangtutphah kimvel ah sakhituihup, emerald suang bang mai a kimu in a zam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan huai mangtutphah kimvel ah mangtutphah dang sawmnih leh li a om a; tua mangtutphahte tung ah Upa sawmnih leh li puanngou a kizema tu ka muta a, amau dangkaeng lallukhu a khu chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai mangtutphah a kipan in khophiate, awte, leh vanpi gingte a hong suakkhia hi. Huan mei khawnvak sagih, mangtutphah ma ah a kuang a, huaite Pathian Kha sagihte ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai mangtutphah ma ah Kristal bang a siang limlang tuipi a om hi. Huai mangtutphah kimvel ah ganhing nunglam leh malam mit a dim a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ganhing khatna humpinelkai bang ahi a, ganhing nihna bawngnou bang ahi a, ganhing thumna in mihing mai bang a nei hi, ganhing lina muvanlai lenglai bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai ganhing lite’n kha guk a neichiat ua, tua khate kimvel leh a sunglam a mit a dim ahi: amau sun leh zan khawllou in, “Siangthou, Siangthou, Siangthou, Toupa Pathian, Bangkim hihthei, omsa omlel leh hongom ding,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan huai amah mangtutphah tung a tupa leh huai amah tangtawn tangtawn a hingpa kiang a ganhingte’n, thupina leh zah-omna leh kipahna thu a piak chiang un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah mangtutphah tung a tupa ma ah Upa sawmnih leh lite a khupboh uhi, huai mangtutphah ma a a manglukhute uh koih in, amah tangtawn tangtawn a hingpa a bia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Nang ka Toupa leh ka Pathian uh, thupina, zahhuaina, thilhihtheihna mutak na hi; thil tengteng nang na bawl a, nang thu ziak a om leh siam ahi uhi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai mangtutphah tung a tupa khut taklam ah laibu a sunglam leh a pawlam kigelh chiamtehna sagih a chiamteh ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Angel hat khat in aw ngaihtak in, “Kua ahia laibu hong a, huai a chiamtehnate phel tham?” chi a phuangkhia ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan vantung hi in, leitung hiam, ahihkeileh lei nuai ah leng huai laibu hongthei hiam, ahihkeileh a tung enthei kuamah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in huai laibu hong a simtak hiam, ahihkeileh a tung entak kuamah a omlouh ziak in ka kapkap hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan upate lak a khat in ka kiang ah, “Kap kenla ngai in, humpinelkai, Juda nam a, David Zung in, laibu hongthei ding leh huai a chiamtehna sagihte phelthei ding in a vualzouta” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan huai mangtutphah leh huai ganhing lite leh huai upate lai ah thahsa hileh kilawm, Belamnou, ki sagih leh mit sagih nei ding ka mu a, huai mit sagihte Pathian kha sagih leitung tengteng a sawlkhiakte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah a hongpai a, mangtutphah tung a tupa khut taklam a kipan laibu a lata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai laibu a laktak in, ganhing lite leh Upa sawmnih leh lite, gawsem khat chiat leh dangkaeng belhbute gimnamtui a dimchiat tawi in, Belamnou ma ah a khupboh ua, huai gimnamtui misiangthoute thumna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan la thak khat a sa uhi: “Laibu la a, huai a chiamtehnate phel tham na hi: thah in na omta a, chichih leh pauchih leh michih leh namchih a mite Pathian ading a na sisan a na leitak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka Pathian kiang uah amau Lalgam leh siampute hi ding in na bawl a; Amau leitung ah vai a hawm ding uh” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan ka etleh, mangtutphah leh ganhingte leh upate kimvel ah, angel tampi aw ka zata hi. A tam dan uh sangsawm mun sangsawm leh a sang a sang tampi ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amau aw ngaihtak in: “Thah a om, Belamnouin hatnate, hauhsaknate, thilhihtheihnate, zahtakhuainate, thupinate, vualzawlnate mu tham na hi” chi in a kikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan thilsiam khempeuh van a omte, leitung a omte, leinuai a omte, tuipi tung a omte leh amau a thil omte tengteng in: “Mangtutphah tung a tupa leh Belamnou kiang ah: Vualzawlnate, zahtakhuainate, thupinate leh vaihawmnate, tangtawn tangtawn in om hen” a chih uh ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan ganhing lite’n, “Amen!” a chi uhi. Upate a khupboh ua, a beta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belamnou in chiamtehna sagihte lak a khat a phellai ka mu a, ganhing lite lak a khat aw in, vanpiging bang mai in, “Hongpai in,” a chih ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka et leh ngai in, sakol kang leh a tung a tupa thalpeu tawi ka muta a; amah kiang ah lallukhu piak in a om a; amah vualzou a vualzou zouzel ding in a hong paikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan chiamtehna nihna a phellai in, ganhing nihna, in “Hongpai in” a chih ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sakol dang khat a san, hong paikhia hi: huai tung a tupa kiang ah leitung a kipan lemna lakhe ding a thupiak ahi a, huchi a amau a kithah tuahna ding un: amah kiang a namsau thupi piak ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan chiamtehna thumna a phellai in ganhing thumna in, “Hongpai in,” a chih ka zata hi. Ka etleh ngai in, sakol vawm ka muta hi; a tung a tupa’n a khut in bukna a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan ganhing lite lai ah aw hileh kilawm in, “Huitbuh tehna dan khat shilling khat, huan barli buh tehna danthum in shilling khat, huan thau leh uain zaw hihse ken” a chih ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chiamtehna lina a phellai in, ganhing lina aw in, “Hongpai in,” a chih ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka et leh ngai in, sakol daang ka muta hi: a tung a tupa min Sihna ahi a, Misikhua toh a kizui uhi. Namsau, kial leh sihna leh leitung a gam sahangte thah ding in amau kiang ah leitung seh li suah seh khat tung a thuneihna piak ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chiamtehna ngana a phellai in, Pathian thu ziak leh a zuih uh theihsakna ziak a amau thah a omte maitam nuai ah ka muta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute aw ngaihtak a kikou in, “Toupa Tungnungpen aw, siangthou leh dik bangtan ka sisan man uh amau leitung a tengte tung a thuklou leh vaihawmlou ding na hia?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaute kiang ah puanngou thupi piak in a om chiat ua: amau a sikha hihpihte uleh a unaute uh amau bang a thah a om dingte akim mateng uh na khawl tadih un chi a hilh in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chiamtehna gukna a phellai ka mu a, zinling thupitak a om hi: Ni samul saiip puan bang in a vawmta a, kha leng a pum in sisan bang in a santa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Van aksite theipi kung huihpi in a mut ling a, a hutte a pulh bang in leitung ah a pulhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Van laibuzial bang a kizial zou in suanmang in a omta: tangsangte leh tuikulh gam teng a mun ua pat suanmang in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in leitung kumpipate, miliante, heutute leh ahat leh ahaute, salte leh sallou teng leng tangsangte leh suangpi heng leh kawkhukte ah a kiselta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tangsangte kiang leh suangpite kiang ah, “Hon delhlum unla, amah mangtutphah tung a tupa leh Belamnou thangpaihna mai a kipan honsel un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thangpaihna ni thupi hongtung hi; kua ading zou dia?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai thilte zoh in angel li, lei kil li a dingte’n leitung a huih lite leitung a nunglou ding leh tuipitung hiam, ahihkeileh singtung hiam a nunglou ding in a khawlsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan amau chiamtehna apat angel dang kuantou ka muta hi, Pathian hing chiamtehna a nei ua; aman huai angel lite leitung leh tuipi hihse dia piak a omte kiang ah aw ngaihtak a kikou in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian sikhate a tal ua i chiamteh zohma in leitung leh tuipi leh singte hihse kei un, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai chiamteh a omte lak a tampi, nuai khat leh sing li leh sang li, Israel suan chiteng a kipan chiamteh zah ka zata hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juda chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih chiamteh in a om ua, Reuben chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih; Gad chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asher chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih; Naphtali chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih; Manasseh chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Simeon chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih; Levi chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih; Issakar chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zebulun chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih, Joseph chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih, Benjamin chi a kipan sing khat leh sang nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai thilteng zoh in ka et leh ngai in, mipi tampi kuamah simsenglouh, namchih leh chichih leh mi tengteng leh pau tengteng a kipan mangtutphah leh Belamnou ma a ding a, puanngou thupi a kizem a tumnah tawi ka muta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan amau aw ngaihtak in, “Mangtutphah a tu i Pathian leh Belamnou kiang ah hotdamna” chi in a kikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Angel tengteng mangtutphah leh upate leh ganhing lite kimvel in a ding ua; mangtutphah ma a khupboh in, Pathian a bia uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Amen, Vualzawlnate, thupinate, pilnate, zahtakhuainate, thilhihtheihnate, hatnate, tangtawn tangtawn in i Pathian kiang ah om hen” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan upate lak a khat in ka kiang ah, “Hiai puanngou thupi a kizemte kuate ahi ua, koi a kipan a hong ahi ua? chi in a hon houpih hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ken a kiang ah, “Ka Toupa, nang na thei hi” ka chi hi. Huan aman ka kiang ah, “Hiai mite gimthuakna thupi a kipan hongpai ahi ua, a puanthupi uh sawp in, Belamnou sisan in a hihngou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in Pathian mangtutphah ma ah a om ua, sun leh zan in a Pathian biakin uah amah a sep sak uhi; Amah mangtutphah tung a tupa’n amau tung ah a puan in a zak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A gil uh kial nawn ken chin, a dang uh tak nawn himhim ken teh, amau ni in kang ken chin, satna in leng a hihgim kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Belamnou huai mangtutphah lak a om A belamchingpa uh a hih ding ziak in, amau hinna tuikhuk ah a piding a; Pathian in a mit ua kipan khitui a nulhul ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chiamtehna sagihna a phellai in dakkal kimkhat sung van a dai sipsip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian ma a angel sagih dingte ka mu a, amau kiang ah pengkul sagih piak in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan angel dang khat a hongpai a, gimnamtui halna dangkaeng bel tawi in, maitam kiang ah a dingta hi, a kiang ah gimnamtui tampi mangtutphah ma a om dangkaeng maitam teng a misiangthou tengteng thumna toh hel ding in, piak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai gimnamtui khu leh misiangthoute thumna angel khut a kipan Pathian ma ah a zamtouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Angel in gimnamtui halna dangkaeng bel a la a; huai maitam a mei in a hihdim a, leitung ah a paikheta hi: huan vangingte leh khophiate leh zinlingte a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan angel sagih pengkul sagih tawite mut ding in a kisata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A masapen in a mutta a, gial leh mei sisan toh kihel a hong omta hi, huaite leitung a paihkhiak in a omta a; leitung mun thum a khen mun khat a kang bei hi, huan sing mun thum a khen mun khat a kang beita a; loupa hing tengteng a kang beita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan angel nihna in a mutta a, mual lianpi mei a kang bang a kang hileh kilawm tuipi ah paihkhiak in a omta hi; tuipi mun thum a khen mun khat sisan a suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai tuipi a ganhingte hinna neite mun thum a khen mun khat a sita ua; long mun thum a khen mun khat hihsiat in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan angel thumna in a mutta a, van a kipan in aksi lianpi, meisel bang a kuang a keta hi, lui mun thum a khen mun khat leh tui tuikhukte tung a deng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai aksi min Khaatna ahi; tui mun thum a khen mun khat khaatna a suak hi; tuite hihkhat a a om ziak un mi tampi a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan angel lina in a mutta a, huan ni mun thum a khen mun khat leh kha mun thum a khen mun khat leh aksi mun thum a khen mun khat hihsiat ahita hi; huchi in a vaknate uh mun thum a khen mun khat hihmial in a omta hi; sun hun seh thum suah seh khat leh zan hun seh thum suah seh khat beisak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan ka etleh, angel khat van laizawl a leng in aw ngaihtak in, “Tunggik, tunggik, tunggik, Angel thum pengkul mutlai dingte leh huai ging hong omlai dingte ziak in leitung a omte tung a gik” a chih ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Angel ngana in a mutta a, van a kipan aksi leitung a kia ka muta hi; amah kiang ah guamkhuk tawbei honna tahbi piak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman guamkhuk tawbei a hongta a; huai guam a kipan in meikhu, meipi khu bang mai a pawttou a, huai guam a meikhu ziak in ni leh huihkhua hihmial in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan meikhu a kipan in khaupe leitung ah a hongsuak a; aikamte’n thilhihtheihna a neih bang in amau thilhihtheihna piak in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau leitung a loupate, thilhing himhimte, leh sing peuhmahte, hihselou a, mi kuapeuh a tal ua Pathian chiamtehna neiloute kia hihse dia hilh in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau that lou ding a, kha nga amau hih genthei zaw ding a hilh in a om uhi; huai a hihgentheihna aikam in mi a teh a gentheihna bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in min sihna a zong ding ua, bangchi mah in a mu kei ding uh; sih a ut ding ua, himahleh sihna in amau a taimangsan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan khaupete mel sakol kidouna a pang dia bawl bang ahi ua; a lutung uah lallukhu hileh kilawm dangkaeng hileh kilawm a om a, a mai uh mihingte mai a bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Numei sam bang sam a nei ua, a ha uh humpinelkai ha bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A awm uah sik awmphawte a nei ua; a khazap ging uh kidouna lam a sakol tampi tai dupdup, kidouna kangtalai tampi ging bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan aikam bang in meigu nei a nei ua, mihingte kha nga hihnatna ding in a mei uah a thilhihtheihna a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaute’n guamkhuk tawbei neitu angel a tung ua kumpipa in a nei uhi: amah min bel Hebru pau in Abaddon ahi a, Grik pau in Appolion ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tunggikna masapen a beita a ngai in, tunggikna nih tunung chiang in a hong tunglai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan angel gukna in a mut a, Pathian ma a om dangkaeng maitam ki a kipan in aw ka zata hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai aw in angel gukna pengkul nei kiang ah, “Luipi Euphrates lui a angel li hen a omte phel in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan angel lite phel in a omta ua, amau mi mun thum a khen mun khat a thah theihna ding un, dak khat leh ni khat leh kha khat leh kum khat kisa in a na omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan sakol tungtuang sepaih a tamdan uh sing ngen mun sing nih ahi chi a a tamdan uh kigen ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchibang in kilakna in sakolte leh a tung ua tuangte, mei bang a san, engdup leh kat bang a eng, awmphaw neite ka muta hi: sakolte lu humpinelkai lu bang ahi ua; a kam ua kipan in mei leh meikhu leh kat a suakkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan a kamsung ua kipan in hii thum, mei, meikhu leh kat hong pawtkhia in mihing munthum a khen mun khat thah in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai sakolte thilhihtheihna a kam uh leh a mei ua om ahi a; a mei uh gulpi mei toh a kibang ua, lu leng a nei ua, huaite in mi a hihna uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan midang huai gawtna a siloute a khut ua sepkhiakte ah a kisik tuankei uhi; dawite, dangkaengte, milimte, dangka milimte, suang milimte, leh sing milimte; mutheiloute, zatheilou leh tangtheiloute be nawnlou ding in kisik tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan a tualthahna uh, a mibumna uh leh a kingaihna khelhna uh leh a guktakna uh a kisik tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan meipi puansilh a kizem angel hat dang van a kipan hongpai khesuk ka muta hi: sakhituihup a lu tung ah a om a, a mai ni a bang a, a khete mei khuamte bang mai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A khut a laibu neuchik honsa a tawi a; a khe taklam a tuipi tung sik in a khe veilam leitung ah a nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Humpinelkai humham bang in aw ngaihtak in a kikou a: a kikou khit in vanpiging sagihte’n a aw uh a suah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan vanpiging sagihte’n a aw uh a suahtak un gelh ding in ka kisa hi; Van a kipan aw in, Vanpiging sagihte thugen im bikbek inla gelhkhe ken” a chih ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan tuipi tung leh leitung a angel ding ka muh in Vanlam ah a khut taklam a liktouta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in huai tangtawn a hing van leh lei leh asung a om tengteng leh tupi leh asung a om tengteng siampa minlou in a zekai nawnlouhna ding chi in a kichiamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh angel sagihna in a mut ding pengkulpi a gin chiang in, huai hun chiang in “Pathian thuguk, a sikha zawlneite kiang a a genkhiaktak hihkim in a omta ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Van a kipan a ka aw zak in kei hon houpih in, “Kuan inla, tuipi tung leh leitung a angel ding khut a laibu neuchik honsa vala in,” a chih ka za nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei, angel kiang ah ka vahohta a, laibu neu honpe ding in a kiang ah ka vagen hi. Aman ka kiang ah, “La inla, nezou vek in; huai in na gil hihkha inchin himahleh na kam ah khuaizu bang in a khum ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan angel khut a kipan in laibu neuchik ka lata a, ka nezou vek a; ka kam ah khuaizu bang in a khum a; huan ka nekzohtak in ka gil hihkhat in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan ka kiang ah, “Mi tampite leh namte leh paute leh kumpipate kiang ah Pathian thusuak na genkholh nawn ngeingei ding ahi” a honchi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan tehna chiang hileh kilawm sialluang chiang khat piak in ka om a: angel in, “Thou inla, Pathian biakin leh maitam leh huai a bete teh in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />biakin huangsung nusia inla, tehken; Jentelte kiang a piaksa a hihtak ziak in; huan khaw siangthou a khenuai un kha sawmli leh kha nih a sikden ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan ka palai nihte kiang ah thilhihtheihna ka pedia, amau saiip puan silh in ni sang khat leh ni za nih leh ni sawmguk thu a genkhol ding uh a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiaite olive sing nihte leh khawnvak koihna nihte, leitung a Toupa ma a dingte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi kuapeuh in amau suknat a tup ualeh, a kam ua kipan a mei hong suakkhia in, a melmate a kangtum vek dia; kuapeuh in amau hihnat a tup ualeh huchibang a thah in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai mite’n a thu genkholh sung ua vuah zuklouhna ding in, van khak theihna a nei ua; huan a ut hunhun ua sisan suaksak ding in tuite tung ah thu a nei ua, leitung leng gawtna chiteng a gawt ding in thu a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan a theihpihna nasep uh a zoh chiang un, huai gamsa kawkhuk tawbei a kipan a hong pawtkhia in amau a kidou pih ding a, amau a zou dia, a that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A siluang uh khopi thupi kongzing ah a kisial a, huai khalam thu ah Sodom leh Aigupta kichi Toupa Kros a kilhlup a a omna mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite leh chite leh paute leh namte lak a kipan mite a luang uh ni thum leh a kim a en ua, a luang uh han a vui a phal kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in leitung a tengte amaute tung a kisial in a kipak ua, kipahna a bawl ua; thilpiakte a kikhak tuah ua; hiai zawlnei nihte’n amau leitung a tengte a thuakgimsak khittak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan ni thum leh a kim nung in, Pathian a kipan in hinna hatna amau ah a honglutta a, amau khe un a dingta uhi; amau mu tengteng tung ah nakpi a launa a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Van a kipan in aw thupitak a zata ua, “Hiai ah hong paitou un,” chi in. Huan amau meilak ah van ah a paitou uhi; a melmate un amau a mu chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai dak in zinling thupitak a omta a, khopi mun sawm a khen mun khat a chimta hi; huai zinling in mi sang sagih thah in a omta ua; a dangte a lauta uhi, van a Pathian kiang ah thupina a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tunggikna nihna tuh a beita a: ngai in, tunggikna thumna a hong tungpah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan angel sagihna in a pengkul a mutta hi; van ah aw thupitak in a zuita a, “Leitung lalgam i Toupa leh a Khrist a a hong hita hi; aman tangtawn in vai a hawm ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Upa sawmnih leh li, mangtutphah tung a Pathian ma a tute’n a mai ua leisi in, Pathian a bia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Na tung ah ka kipak uhi, Toupa Pathian Bangkim hihthei, omlel leh omsa leh hongom ding; na thilhihtheihna thupi na laktak ziak in leh vai na hawmtak ziak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Namte a heh ua, tuin nang thangpaihna ni a hongtungta hi, misite vai na hawmsak hun leh na sikha zawlneite leh misiangthoute kiang leh na min kihtate milian leh mineute kiang a kipahman na piakna hun leh leitung hihsete hihsiat a a omsam hun uh a hongtungta hi,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan van a om Pathian biakin hon in a omta a; biakin sung a thukhun bawm a hong kimuta hi; huchi in khophiate, awte, vangingte, zinlingte leh gial thupitak in a zuita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Van ah chiamtehna thupi leh lamdangtak: numei khat ni a kizem, a khenuai a khapi sikden leh a lu tung a lallukhu aksi sawmlehnih khu a hong kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman nau a pai a, nauvei leh suakkhe ding natna in a kapkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan van ah thillamdang thupi khat a hong kilang a; ngai in, dragon san lianpi, lu sagih leh ki sawm nei, a lu tung a lallukhu sagih khu a hong kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mei in van a aksite mun thum a khen mun khat a kaikhia a, leitung ah a paikheta hi; dragon in huai numei naunei dia kisa, a neih chiang a a nau nekzoh tum in a ma ah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ta pasal naupang, sik chiang a nam tengteng tung a vaihawm ding a neita hi; tua tapa Pathian leh a mangtutphah ah laktouh in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Numei pen gamdai ah, Pathian in amah adia a mun bawlsak ah, huai ah ni sang khat leh ni za nih leh ni sawmguk khoi a om ding in a taita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan van ah kidouna a om a: Mikael leh angelte dragon toh kidou ding in a kuan khia ua; dragon leh a angelte’n leng a dou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan a zoukei ua, van ah a mun himhim uh muh in a omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dragon lian, gulpi tek, Diabol leh Setan chih a ompa, khovel pumpi khempa leh amah nasem angelte toh van apan paih khiaksuk in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan van ah aw ngaihtak mai ka za hi, “Tun ah i Pathian hotdamna a hongtungta, thilhihtheihna, leh Khrist thuneihna; i unaute hekpa, i Pathian ma a sun leh zan a amau hekpa, paihkhiaksuk a a om ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Belamnou sisan ziak leh a theihpih uh thu ziak in amah tung ah a vualzouta ua; sih tanpha’n leng a hinna uh a it kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in kipak un, aw van leh nou asung a tengte, Lei leh tuipi ading in a tung uh a gik; Diabol in hun tomchik phet a nei chih a kitheih ziak in, a heh mahmah a na kiang uah a hong paisukta hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dragon leitung a paihkhiak ahita chih a kitheihtak in, huai numei nau pasal neinu a gawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai numei kiang ah muvanlai thupitak kha nih piak in a omta a, gulpi mai a kipan gamdai mun a a lenlut theihna ding in, huai ah hun khat sung leh hunte leh hun kimkhat sung vak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gulpi in a kam a kipan in tuipi bang tuiluang a numei a taihmangsak theihna ding in numei nung ah a sekheta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lei in numei a panpihta a, lei in a kam a ka ta a, dragon in a kam a kipan a a tui siatkhiak a na valhzohsak vekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dragon numei tung ah a heh mahmah a, a suan omsun, Pathian thupiak zuite leh Jesu thu theihpihte kidoupih ding in a kuankheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan Dragon tuipiau ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuipi piau a ka din leh tuipi a kipan gamsa khat, ki sawm leh lu sagih nei, a kite tung a lallukhu sawm om chiat, a lu tungte a Pathian gensiatna om, hong paikhetou ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka gamsa muh gialbem a bang a, a khe vompi khe a bang a, a kam humpinelkai kam a bang hi: dragon in a thuneihna thupi leh a mangtutphah leh a thilhihtheihnate amah a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lute lak a khat sihpih khop hial dia liam hileh kilawm in ka mu hi; sihpih khop hial dia liam pen hihdam in a omta a; huchi in leitung pumpi in huai gamsa lamdangsa in a zuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dragon, gamsa kiang a a thuneihna petu a bia uhi; huchi in hiai gamsa a biak kawm in, “Hiai gamsa bang kua om a, amah kidoupih thei kua om hiam?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan gamsa kiang ah thil thupite leh Pathian gensiatnate genna ding kam piak in a omta a; huan a kiang ah thuneihna piak in a om hi, kha sawmli leh nih thilhihtheihna piak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian gensiatna ding, a min gense ding leh a omna, van a tengte ngei gensia in a kamkata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan Dragon in gamsa kiang ah misiangthoute kidoupih ding leh amau zou ding in phalna a pia a: chichih, pauchih leh namchih tung a thuneihna leng a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan khovel om tung a kipat a belamnou thahsa hinna laibu a a min tuangloute tengteng leh leitung a teng tengteng in amah a be ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kuapeuh zakna ding bil nei in zata hen!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kuapeuh sal a pi dingte sal a pi in a om ding; kuapeuh namsau a thah dingte namsau a thah in a om ding. Hiai ah misiangthoute kuhkal na leh ginna neiding a chial ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan gamsa dang khat leitung a kipat a hongpawt khetou ka muta a; belamnou bang in ki nih a nei a, dragon bang in thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamsa masapen thuneihna tengteng a mitmuh in a zang hi. Leitung leh asung a teng tengteng gamsa masapen, sikhop hial a liam a hihdam a om, be ding in a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan mite mitmuh in van a kipan in leitung a mei kesuk thei khop in thillamdang pipi a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan gamsa sik leh a mitmuh a thillamdang hihtheihna piak a a omna in aman leitung a tengte a khemta a; huai gamsa namsau a satliam leh damnawn lim bawl ding in lei a tengte thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gamsa masa lim a nakna peding leh tua gamsa a pautheihna ding in Dragon in amah kiang ah thilhihtheihna a pia a, tua bel gamsa lim be nuamlou tengteng leng a thahsak theihna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi tengteng, a lian a neu, a zawng a hau, sikha leh sikha lou, a khut taklam uh hiam, a tal uah hiam a chiamtehna piak in a om chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai bel kuamah in huai chiamtehna hiam, gamsa min hiam, ahihkeileh a min nambat neiloute’n lei theilou, zuak theilou a a omna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiai ah pilna a om hi. Kuapeuh theihsiamna nei in, gamsa nambat sutkhia hen; mihing nambat ahi a; nambat tuh za guk sawmguk leh guk ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai nung in ka et leh, ngai in, Zion tang tung a Belamnou ding ka muta a, a kiang ah mipi nuaikhat singli leh sangli, a Pa min a tal ua kigelh chiatte toh a ding khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tui tampi leh vanpiging bang a ging van a kipan in aw ka zata hi; ka aw zak gosem tumte’n a gosem uh a tumging uh a bang hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangtutphah leh ganhing lite ma leh upate ma ah la thak hileh kilawm khat a sa ua: leitung a kipat a huai leikhiaksate, nuaikhat singli leh sanglite loungal kuamah in huai la a thei theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiaite numei lak a kihihnin loute ahi ua; nungak siangthou bang ahi uhi. Hiaite a paina lamlam ua Belamnou zuite ahi uhi. Pathian ading leh Belamnou ading a gah masapen hi ding a mite lak a kipan a leisa ahi uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan a kam uah zuau a omkei a; Pathian mangtutphah ma ah gensiat bei ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan angel dang vanlai zawl a leng ka mu a, aman tangtawn Tanchinhoih, leitung a tengte kiang leh namchih leh chichih leh pauchih leh michihte kiang a genkhiak ding a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw ngaihtak in, “Pathian kihta unla, amah thupina pia un; a vaihawmna hun a hongtungta ngal a; van leh lei leh tuipi leh tuikhukte siampa amah bia un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan angel nihna in a honzui a, “Pukta, pukta Babulon khaw thupi, nam tengteng a mi ngaihhatna, hehna uain dawnsaknu, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Angel thumna in amau a honzuita a aw ngaihtak in, “Kuapeuh gamsa leh a lim bia, a tal hiam a khut hiam a chiamtehna a neite’n
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian thangpaihna uain a dawn ding ua, huai uain thangpaihna nou, bangmah toh hellouh hial a bawl ahi; angel siangthoute leh Belamnou muh in amah mei leh kat in hihnat in om in teh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan a hihnatna meikhu uh tangtawn tangtawn in a zamtou dia; huai gamsa leh a limbete, leh kuapeuh a min chiamtehna neiphot in sun leh zan in tawlngakna a neikei ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai ah misiangthou, Pathian thupiakte leh Jesu ginna zuite kuhkalna nei ding a chialna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan van a kipan in aw in hichibang in, “Gelh in, tua kipan in misite, Toupa a site a hampha uhi”; Kha in, “Ahi, a sepgimna uh a khawlsanta ding ua, a thilhihte un honzui ding a hih ziak in” a chih uh ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan ka et leh ngai in, meipi ngou ka muta a; huai mei tung ah mi khat Mihing Tapa toh kibang, a lu a dangkaeng lallukhu khu, a khut a kawite hiam tawi ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Angel dang Pathian biakin apan hong paikhia a, meipi tung a tupa kiang ah ngaihtak in, “Na kawite lik inla, at in: at hun a tungta hi; lei buh a min gawpta” chi’n a kikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai mei tung a tupa’n leitung ah a kawite a lik a; leitung at in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan van a om Pathian biakin a kipan in angel dang a hong paikhia a, aman leng kawite hiam a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan mei tung a thilhihtheihna nei, angel dang maitam ma a kipan in a hong paikhia a; aman aw ngaihtak in, huai kawite tawipa sam in, “Na kawite hiamtak lik inla, leitung a grep gahbomte khawm in; grepte a min mahmah ta hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai angel in leitung ah a kawite a lik a, leitung a grep gahte a khawmta hi, Pathian thangpaihna, uain sukna thupi, uain sukna ah a pailutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khaw pawlam ah uain sukna chil in a omta a, uain sukna a kipan sisan sakol kamkaihna tanpha louching sang khat leh za guk pha in a luangkhia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan chiamtehna thupi leh lamdang, angel sagih, hi nanung sagih, a nanung pente, Pathian hehna toh kidim tawi, van ah ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan limlang tuipi hileh kilawm, mei toh kihel leh gamsa leh a lim leh a min nambat tung a vualzoute, a khut ua Pathian gosem tawi a, limlang tuipi kiang a ding ka muta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian sikha, Mosi la leh Belamnou la a sa uhi: “Na thilhihte thupi in a lamdang hi. Aw Toupa Pathian, Bangkim hihthei! Na lampite a dik in a tang uhi, Misiangthoute Kumpipa, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw, kuan ahia na min hih thupi a laulou ding? Nang kia siangthou na hi a. Nam tengteng hongpai in na ma ah hong be ding uh, Na thilhih diktatte hihlat in omta ngal ua” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiai thilte ka muh nung in, van a theihsakna biakbuk dantan sungnung hon in a omta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan hiai dantan sungnung a kipan in angel sagih, gawtna sagih nei, puanmalngat siangthou leh vak a kizema, dangkaeng kawnggaka a awm ua kigakte a hong paikhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ganhing lite lak a khat in angel sagihte kiang ah tangtawn tangtawn a hing Pathian hehna a dim dangkaeng belhbu sagihte a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Tempul Pathian thupina a thilhihtheihna a kipan meikhu in hihdim in a omta hi; angel sagihte gawtna sagihte a tunkim masiah asung ah kuamah a lut theita kei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Tempul dantan sungnung a kipan hongsuak aw thupi in, angel sagihte kiang ah, “Kuan unla, leitung ah Pathian thangpaihna belhbu sagihte sungkhia un” a chih ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A masapen a kuan a, leitung ah a belhbu a sungkheta hi, huai gamsa chiamtehna nei, a lim bemite tung ah meima sia leh nai in a hong suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nihna in a belhbu tuipi tung ah a sungkhia a; misite si bang in sisan a hongsuak hi; tuipi sung a thil omte tanpha in hinna nei peuhmah a sita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thumna pen in a belhbu luite leh tuinakte tung ah a sungkhia hi; sisan a hongsuakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuite angel in, “Nang omsa leh omlel, nang Misiangthou, hichibang a vai na hawmtak ziak in na diktat hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amau misiangthoute leh zawlneite sisan a suah ua, nang a dawn ding un sisan na piak hichih tuak ahi him uhi” a chih ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan maitam in, “Ahi, Toupa Pathian aw, Bangkim hihthei, na vaihawmte a dik in a diktathuai hi!” a chih ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lina pen in a belhbu ni a sunkhumta a; amah kiang ah mite mei a hainat theihna piak in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sat a sa a mite hainatin a omta ua; hichibang natnate tung a thilhihtheihna nei, Pathian min a genseta ua; Pathian kiang a thupina pe ding in a kisik tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ngana in a belhbu gamsa tutphah tung ah a sungkheta a; huan a lalgam hihmial in a omta a; amau na sa in a lei uh a keita uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A natna uh leh a meimate uh ziak in amau tuh van a Pathian a gensia ua; a thilhihte uah a kisik tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A gukna in a belhbu luipi, Euphrates luitung ah a sungkheta a; huai tui a kangvekta hi, huchi in suahlama kipan kumpipa hong dingte adia lampi bawlsa a a om theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dragon kam a kipan leh gamsa kam a kipan leh, zawlnei taklou kam a kipan in kha nin thum, ukeng bang mai hong paikhia ka muta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute dawite kha, thillamdang hihte; khovel pumpi leh lei kumpipate kiang a hong a, Pathian Bangkim hihtheipa ni thupi a kidouna adia amaute pikhawmte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ngai in, guta bang in ka hongpai hi. Kiveng leh puan tengsa a om a hampha hi, huchilou in zaw vuaktang in a om dia; a zumhuaina a mu kha ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in amaute mun khat Hebru pau a ‘Armageddon’ kichi ah a pikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A sagihna in a belhbu huihkhua tung ah a sungkheta hi; mangtutphah a kipan in dantan sungnung ah aw ngaihtak a hong suakkhia a, “Zoh ahita!” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in khophiate, awte, vangingte a hong omta a; zinling thupi, huchibang a thupi leh hat leitung a mihing om nungsiah om ngeilou a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khopi thupi mun thum in a kikhenta a, namte khopite a chimta uhi; Babulon khopi thupi Pathian mitmuh in theihgige in a om a, a hehna kihtakhuai uain nou a dawn ding in piak in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuikulh gam chiteng a taimangta ua, tangsangte muhphak in a omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan van a kipan in gial lianpipi, talent khat a gik mite tung ah a hong kesukta hi; mite’n huai gial a gawtna ziak in Pathian a gensia ua; huai gawtna a thupi mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai thilnung in angel sagih belhbu sagih tawite lak a khat hongpai in kei a hon houpih hi, “Hongpai in, tui tampite tung a tu kizuaknu thupi tung a vaihawmna k’on ensak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung kumpipate amah toh a kingai ua, huan a mingaihna uain in leitung a tengte khamsak in a om” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman Kha in gamdai ah hon pawmangta a: huan gamsa san-au, Pathian gensiatna min a pumdim, lu sagih leh kisawm nei tung a numei khat tu ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai numei in puan sandup leh puan sandang a silh a, dangkaeng leh suangmantam leh tuikepsuang in a kizem hi; a khut in dangkaeng nou, thil kihhuaite leh a mi ngaihna thilninte a dim a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan a taltang ah min thuguk, “Babulon thupi, kizuakte leh leitung a kihhuaite nu,” chih a kigelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan huai numei misiangthoute sisan leh Jesu martarte sisan dawnkham in ka mu hi. Huainu ka muhtak in lamdang ka sa mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan angel in ka kiang ah, “Bangding a lamdang sa na hia? Huai numei leh amah pua gamsa, lu sagih leh kisawm nei, thuguk k’on hilh ding a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai na gamsa muh a omkhin a, huan a omkei a; kawkhuk tawbei a kipan a hong paikhe ding ahi, manthatna a pai ding ahi. Huan leitung a tengte, khovel siam tung a kipan a hinna laibu a min gelhlouhte’n tua gamsa omkhin a, omlou leh hongom ding a hihdan a muh chiang un lamdang a sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hiai ah pilna lungsim a kul. Lu sagihte numei tutna tangsang sagihte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan kumpipa sagihte ahi ua; nga a pukkhin ua, khat a omlel a, khat a hongtung naikei hi. A hongtun chiang in, hun tomchik sung a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai gamsa omkhin a, tua omlou pen kumpi giatna ahi. Amah sagihte lak a tel ahi; huan manthatna ah a pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Huan ki sawm na muhte, lalgam nei nailou, kumpipa sawmte ahi ua; himahleh dakkal khat lel, huai gamsa toh amau kumpipate bang in thuneihna a nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiaite’n lungsim khat nei in, gamsa kiang ah a thilhihtheihna leh a thuneihna uh a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiaite’n Belamnou a kidou pih ding ua, Belamnou in amau a zou ding, amah toupate Toupa leh kumpipate KUMPIPA a hih ziak in; amah toh omkhawmte bel sapte, telte leh muanhuaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Kizuaknu tutna tui na muhte mite leh mipite leh namte leh paute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ki sawm na muhte leh na gamsa muhte’n kizuaknu a mudah ding ua, suanbei leh vuaktang a suaksak ding uhi, a sa a ne ding ua, amah mei in a haltum vek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian thu hihkim a a om mateng, amah deihlam a hihna ding uleh, lungsim khat a neihna ding uleh, a lalgam uh gamsa kiang a a piakna ding un, Pathian in amau ah ngaihtuahna a koihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan na numei muh khopi thupi, leitung kumpipate tung a vaihawmnu ahi” a chilai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai thilnung in van a kipan angel dang, thuneihna liantak nei, van a kipan hong paikhesuk ka muta hi; a thupina in leitung tuh a vaksak ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw ngaihtak in a kikouta a, “Chimta, chimta Babulon khopi thupi, dawite omna leh kha nin tengteng kulh leh vasa nin leh huathuai teng kulh a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nam tengteng in a mi ngaihna hehna uain a nam tengteng dawn khamsak a om ua, leitung Kumpipate’n amah a kingaihpih ua, leitung sumsinte nuamtat luatna a hong hauhtak ziak un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan van a kipan in aw dang in hichibang in a gen hi: “Ka mite a khelhna a na pan khaklouhna ding un leh ahi na kailouhna ding un, amah a kipan in hong paikhia un, a chih ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A khelhna van a tungta a, Pathian in a khelhnate a theigige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman honpiak bangmah a kiang ah pia unla, amah gamtatna a leh nih in thukkik un: a helna nou ah amah ading in a leh nih in helsak un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ki thupisakna zahzah leh a noptalna zah in amah bawlgim un, hih lungkham un: aman a lungsim in, ‘Kumpinu in ka tu a, meithai ka hi kei, bangchi mah in lungkham ngeikei ding,’ a chih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in ni khat sung in hipi a gawtna, sihna, lungkhamna leh kialna a hongtung ding hi; huan amah mei in haltum vek in om inteh; amah tung a vaihawm Toupa Pathian a hat ziak in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan leitung a kumpipate amah kingaihpih leh nuamtat a omte’n, amah haltumna meikhu a muh chiang un, amah kah in mau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thuakna a hihnat a om ding lau in gamlapi ading in, “Maizen! Maizen! khopi thupi Babulon! Dak kal khat sung a na tung a vaihawmna a hongtun tak ziak in” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan leitung a sumsinte’n, a sumsinna van uh kuamah in a leilouh ziak un, kap in a sun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan a sumsinna vante uh bel: Dangkaeng leh dangka a sumsinna van, suangmantam, tuikepsuang, puanmalngat hoih, puansan, maimom puan, puan eng, singnamtui, saiha a bawl van, sing mantam pen chi a van bawl tengteng, sumsan leh sik leh marbul sung a belsuan bawl tengteng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />leh singguithak, namtui, namtui haichi, thau namtui, chim, uain, thau, buhnel, buh, belam, huan sakol kangtalai leh sal, mite hinna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Huan na lungsim a na deih, gahte’n nang hon taimangsan ua, thil limchi leh hoih teng in nang a hon manthat san ua, muhnawn ahi ngeikei ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiai thilte a sumsinte, amah ziak a hau a bawlte’n, amah hihnat a a omna lau in gamlapi ading in, kap in a sun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Maizen! Maizen! khopi thupi, puanmalngat hoih leh a san leh a eng a kizem a, dangkaeng leh suangmantam leh tuikepsuang a kivannu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dakkal khat in hichitel a hauhna thupi bangmahlou a bawl a om ziak in” a chi ding uhi. Huan longpute leh koilam lam a long a hongtungte leh longmite leh tuipi a nekzong tengteng gamlapi ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau khopi kang leh halna meikhu a muh chiang un “Hiai bang khaw thupi om ngei hiam” chi in a kikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan amau lutung ah leivui a kibuak ua a kikou ua, kap leh sun in, “Maizen! Maizen! khaw thupi huai a tuipi a mi longnei tengteng amah hauhsakna ziak a hauhsak in a om uhi! Dakkal khat sung in amah bangmahlou hita mai” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw nang van, amah tung ah kipak unla, Aw nou misiangthoute, leh nou sawltakte leh nou zawlneite; na tung ua a vaihawmna Pathian in amah tung ah vai a hawmtak ziak in kipak un a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan angel hat khat in buhgawina suang lianpi hileh kilawm suang khat a domta a, tupi ah a pailut a, “Hichibang in khopi thupi, Babulon nakpi a hihchip in om in chin, muhkhiak nawnlouh hial in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gosem tumte leh lasiamte leh tamngai tumte leh pengkul tumte, na sung ah kiza nawn kei hial ding hi. Khutsiam siamna nei himhim, na sung ah muhkhiak in omnawn kei hial un chin; khawl ging na sung ah kiza nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na sung ah meivak a vaknawn kei ding hi; mouneipa aw leh mou aw na sung ah a kiza nawn kei ding hi: na sumsinte leitung kumpipate ahi ngal ua; na bumsiamna in nam tengteng khem in a omta uhi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah sung ah zawlneite sisan, leh misiangthoute sisan leh leitung a thah a omte tengteng sisan a ki mukhia hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai thilnung in van ah mipi aw hileh kilawm in, “Hallelujah! Hotdamna leh thupina leh thilhihtheihna i Pathian a ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A vaihawmna a dik in a kizen hi; kizuaknu thupi leitung a, a mingaihna a hihsenu tung a vai a hawmtak ziak in, Aman a sikhate sisan amah tung ah a thukta,” a chih ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Hallelujah! Huai khopi halna meikhu tangtawn tangtawn in a zamtou hi,” chi in a kikou nawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Upa sawmnih leh lite leh ganhing lite a khupboh ua, Pathian mangtutphah a tupa a beta uhi, “Amen, Hallelujah!” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan mangtutphah a kipan in aw a hong pawtkhia a, “Nou a sikhate aw, na vek un, a neu a lian, nou amah laute, Pathian phatna pia un” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipi tampi aw hileh kilawm tui tampi ging bang leh vanpiging bang aw in, “Hallelujah! Toupa i Pathian Bangkim hihthei in vai a hawm ziak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nuamni, nakpitak in kipakni, Amah kiang ah thupina pia in: Belamnou zineih hun a hongtungta hi. A zi leng a kisakkhit tak ziak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah puanmalngat hoih leh siangthou a kizepna ding in piak in a omta hi, a chih ka za hi, tua puanmalngat hoih misiangthoute nasep diktatte ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan angel in ka kiang ah, “Gelh in, Belamnou zineihna nitak Ankuang um ding a chial a omte a hampha uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan amah be ding in a khebul ah ka pukta hi. Huan ka kiang ah, “Hon be kei hial in: Jesu thu theihpihna kem nangmah unau leh sikha hihpih ka hi; Pathian be zaw in, Jesu thu theihpihna genkholhna kha a hih ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan van kihong ka muta hi; Ngai in, sakol kang leh a tung a tuang Ginom leh Dik kichi leng ka mu hi; Aman dikna a vaihawm in kidouna a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mit meikuang bang ahi a, a lutung ah lallukhu tampi a om a, min khat amah loungal kuamah theihlouh kigelh a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah puan sisan a diah in a kizem a; a min, “Pathian Thu” chih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah van a om sepaih hon puanmalngat hoih, ngou leh siangthou silh a sakol kang tung ah tuang in a honzui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kam a kipan in namte a satna ding, namsau hiam khat a hong suakkhia hi: amau tung ah sikchiang in vai a hawm dia: Pathian Bangkim hihthei hehna lauhuaina uain sukna a chil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A puan tung leh a phei tung ah min, “KUMPIPATE KUMPIPA, LEH TOUPATE TOUPA” chih a kigelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan angel khat ni ading ka mu a; amah aw ngaihtak a kikou in, van laizawl a vasa leng tengteng kiang ah, “Hong unla, Pathian nitakan thupi ah hong kikhawm vek un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipate sa, sepaih heutute sa, mi hatte sa, sakolte sa, a tung a tute sa, mi tengteng sa, sikha leh sikha loute sa, leh milian leh mineu sa na nek theihna ding un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai gamsa leh leitung a kumpipate leh a sepaihte uh, huai sakol tung a tuangpa leh a sepaihte kidoupih ding in a hong kikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gamsa mat in a omta a, zawlnei taklou, a ma a chiamtehna hih a gamsa chiamtehna neite leh amah limbete a khempa toh a man khawm a: a nih tuak un a hing in meidil, kat a kang sung ah paihlut in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan a dangte huai sakol tung a tupa kam a kipan a hongsuak namsau a thah in a omta uhi; amau sa in vasa tengteng gilvah in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan angel khat van a kipan a hong paikhesuk, a khut a kawkhuk tawbei honna tahbi leh khainiang lianpi tawi ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman dragon, gulpi tek, Diabol leh Setan a manta a, kum sang khat sung ding in amah a henta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sang khat a chin ma a namte a khem nawnlouhna ding in amah kawkhuk tawbei ah paihlut in a om a, a khakkhum a, amah a kilhkhumta hi: tu nung in sawtloukal amah khahnawn a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan mangtutphahte leh a tung a tute ka muta hi, amaute kiang ah vaihawmna piak in a omta hi: Jesu thu theihsakna ziak leh Pathian thu ziak a a ngawng uh sattan a omte kha ka mu a, huaite gamsa leh a lim beloute, a tal ua leh a khut ua a chiamtehna neiloute ahi ua; amau a hong hingta ua, Khrist toh kum sang khat vai a hawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiai pen thohnawnna masapen ahi. Misi dangte bel kum sang khat a bei mateng a hingkik kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thohnawnna masapen a pangte a hampha uhi, a siangthou uhi: Amaute tung a sih nihna in hihtheih a neih louh ziak in; himahleh amau Pathian leh Khrist siampute a honghi ding ua, kum sang khat sung amah toh vai a hawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan kum sang khat a bei chiang in, Setan a tanna in a kipan in khahkhiak in a om dia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leitung kil li a om namte, Gog leh Magog khem a amau kidouna mun a pikhawm ding in amah hong paikhe pah dia; a tamdan uh tuipi piaunel bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan amau leitung vailam khaksuak in a paitou ua, misiangthoute giahphual leh khopi it, a kimvel in a umta uhi. Huan van a kipan in mei a hong kesukta a, amaute a kangtum vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan amaute khempa Diabol gamsa leh zawlnei taklou omna, mei leh kat dil ah paihlut in a omta uhi; tangtawn tangtawn in sun leh zan in hihnat in a omta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan mangtutphah ngou thupi leh a tung a tu ka muta a; a mai a kipan lei leh van a taimangta hi, amau ading in mun himhim a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Misite, a neu a lian, huai mangtutphah ma a dingte ka muta hi; laibute a kihong a; laibu dang, hinna laibu leng a kihong a; misite huai laibute a thilkigelhte a kipan in a thilhih bang ua vai hawmsak in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuipi in a sung a om misite a hon pawtsakta a; sihna leh misi khua in a sung ua misi omte a hon pawtsak ua: mi chiteng a thilhih bangbang ua vai hawmsak in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sihna leh misi khua meidil a paihlut in a omta uhi. Hiai mei dilpen sih nihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kuapeuh hinna laibu a kigelh a muhlouh uh, meidil a paihlut in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan van thak leh lei thak ka muta a: van masapen leh lei masapen a beitak ziak un; tuipi leng a om nawnta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khopi siangthou, Jerusalem thak, mou a pasal a ding a kizem bang a bawlzohsa a om, Pathian a kipan van a hong paikhesuk ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan mangtutphah a kipan aw thupitak ka zak in, “Ngai in, Pathian biakbuk mihingte lak ah a omta hi, amau lak ah a teng dia amau a mite ahi ding ua, Pathian mahmah in amau a ompih dia a Pathian uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan a mit ua kipan in khitui tengteng a nulhul dia; sihna a om nawn kei dia; lusun leh kah leh natna himhim leng a om nawn kei ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan mangtutphah tung a tupa’n, “Ngai in, thil tengteng ka siam thakta,” a chi hi. “Gelh in: hiai thute a ginom in a dik uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Sepzoh ahita hi. Kei Alpha leh Omega, a bul leh a tawp ka hi. Dangtakte kiang ah manbei in hinna tuikhuk a tui amau ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kuapeuh a vualzoupa’n hiai thilte a luah dia; a Pathian ka hidia, amah ka tapa ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh dawilokte leh gingtaloute leh, kihhuaite leh tualthatte leh, mingaihhatte leh bumhatte leh, milimbete leh zuautheite tengteng tan tuh dil, mei leh kat a kang, sih nihna ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan angel sagih belhbu sagih leh gawtna sagih nanungpen tawite lak a khat a hongpai a; kei a hon houpih a, "hiai ah hongpai in, mou, Belamnou zi k’on ensak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman Kha in tang lian leh sangpi ah a hon pawmangta hi, huchi in khopi siangthou Jerusalem, Pathian a kipan a van a hong paikhesuk a hon ensak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian thupina a nei a: a vakna suang mantam pen, Jasper suang, Kristal bang in a siang hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kulhbang thupi leh sangpi a nei a; kong sawmlehnih a nei a, huai kongte ah angel sawmlehnih a om ua; huai kongtungte ah Israel suan nam sawmlehnihte min a kigelh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A suahlam ah kongpi thum a om a; a mallam ah kongpi thum, a simlam ah kongpi thum; a tumlam ah kongpi thum a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan khopi kulhbang in nuaiphah sawmlehnih a nei a, huaite tung ah Belamnou Sawltak Sawmlehnihte minte a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan kei hon houpihpa’n khopi leh kongpite leh kulhbangte tehna ding in tehna dangkaeng sialluang a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai khua in ning li a nei a, a dunglam a vailam chia chia in a lian a; a sialluang in khopi a teh a, lou ching sang sawmlehnih ahi a, dunglam leh vailam leh a sanlam a kikim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan angel in huai kulhbang mihing tehna dan in a teh a, tong za leh sawmli leh li a sah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan a khopi kulhbang jasper suang a kibawl ahi a; huan a khopi dangkaeng siang, limlang siang bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai khopi kulhbang suangphum suang mantam chiteng a zep ahi. A suangphum khatna jasper suang ahi a; a nihna sapphir suang, a thumna kalsedoni suang; a lina emerald suang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ngana sardonik suang; a gukna sardi suang; a sagihna kristolait suang; a giatna beril suang; a kuan a topaz suang; a sawmna kristoprai suang; a sawmlehkhatna zasinth suang; a sawmlehnihna amethis suang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan kongpi Sawmlehnihte tuikep suang Sawmlehnihte ahi ua; a kongpite tuikep suang khat chiat a bawl ahi a: Khopi kholak dangkaeng siang ahi a, limlang muhpaisuak theih bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai ah biakin ka mu kei a; Toupa Pathian Bangkim hihthei leh Belamnou biakin a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan a tung a tanvak ding in huai khopi in ni hiam, kha hiam leng a poimawh kei a, Pathian thupina in a tanvak a, Belamnou a meivak uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huai vak ah hotdam namte a khosa ding ua; leitung kumpipate a thupina uh toh a honglut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangchi mah in huai kongpite sun a khak in a omkei ding a, huailai a zan a omlouh ding ziak in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai mun ah namte thupina leh zahtakhuaina laklut ahi ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangchi mah in huai ah thilnin hiam, ahihkeileh kihhuai leh zuaubawl himhim leng a lut kei ding hi. Himahleh Belamnou hinna laibu a min gelhte kia a lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hinna tuisiang luanna lui a hon ensak hi. Huai lui bel Kristal bang a siang, Pathian leh Belamnou mangtutphah apan hong luangkhia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai a kongzing lai, a lui lang tuaktuak ah hinna singgah chi sawm lehnih nei, kha teng a gah a om a: huai singnahte namte hihdamna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan hamsia himhim a omnawn kei ding a; huai ah Pathian leh Belamnou mangtutphah a omta ding hi: a sikhate’n a na a sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaute’n a mel a mu ding ua; amah min a tal uah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan zan himhim a omnawn kei dia; khawnvak vak leh ni vak hiam leng a deih nawn kei ding uhi; Toupa Pathian in amau vakna a piak ding ziak in: amau tangtawn tangtawn in vai a hawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan aman ka kiang ah, hiai thute a muanhuai un a dik uhi: Toupa zawlnei siangthoute Pathian in thil hong ompah mahmah dingte a sikhate kiang ah musak ding in a angel a sawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ngai in, Ka hong paipah ding.” “Hiai laibu a genkholhna thute zui peuhmah a hampha hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan kei Johan, hiai thilte zapa leh mupa ka hi. Huchi a ka zak leh ka muhtak in, hiai thilte hon musakpa angel khebul ah be ding in ka pukta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Hon be kei hial in, hiai laibu thute kem, na unau zawlneite leh nang sikha hihpih ka hi: Pathian be zaw in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Hiai laibu a genkholhnate bilhkhum ken, a hun a naitak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kuapeuh midiklou in diklouhna hih nalai henla, kuapeuh mi nin, nin nalai hen: kuapeuh midiktat, diktat nalai henla; kuapeuh Mi Siangthou, siangthou nalai hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ngai in, ka hong paipah ding hi; michih a thilhih bangzel ua piak ding in ka kiang ah ka kipahman a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Alpha leh Omega, a masapen leh a nanungpen, abul leh atawp ka hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinna sing a honzot theihna ding uleh, kongpi tawn a khopi sung a a lut theihna ding ua a puan uh sawpsiangte a hampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pawlam ah uite, bumhatte, mingaihhatte, tualthatte, milimbete leh kuapeuh zuauthu deih a, zuauthu bawlte a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kei, Jesu’n saptuamte a ding a hiai thilte na kiang ua hon theisak ding in ka angel k’on sawlta hi. David zung leh a suan, zingsol aksi vak ka hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kha leh Mou in, “Hongpai in” a chi uhi. A za peuh in, “Hongpai in” chi hen. Kuapeuh a ut in hinna tui a manbei in dawn hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiai laibu a genkholhna thute za peuh kiang ah ka theisak hi: Mi kuapeuh in hiai thute a behlap leh, Pathian in amau tung ah hiai laibu a kigelh gawtnate a behlap ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan kuapeuh in hiai genkholhna laibu a thute lakmang a neih leh, Pathian in a tan ding hiai laibu a kigelh, hinna sing leh khopi siangthou a kipan a lamang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hiai thilte theisakpa’n, “ Ahi, hong paipah ding ka hi” a chi. Amen! Hongpai in, Toupa Jesu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa Jesu hehpihna noute tengteng tung ah om hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
